WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:06.850
<i>If I am to devote my life to someone,
I will surpass my limitation.</i>

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:12.340
<i>Now and here,
I will become my own strength.</i>

00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:16.490
<i>And I will march toward the future.</i>

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:25.600
<i>There are places I like to forget.
There are memories I like to forget.</i>

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:31.950
<i>I can't get rid of this swirling hesitation...
and my pride is wounded.</i>

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:38.080
<i>The light is covered in dust,
if you see through the darkness...</i>

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:44.500
<i>You can find your path to the new door.</i>

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:50.730
<i>Beautiful sword dances like the wind.</i>

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:57.650
<i>Fate so strong, it creates miracles in my life.</i>

00:00:57.670 --> 00:01:00.220
<i>Flower of Bravery.</i>

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:07.100
<i>Looking only for the truth.
I noticed you were there beside me.</i>

00:01:07.140 --> 00:01:12.820
<i>Your special soul will be our bond.</i>

00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:19.550
<i>A sadness I can't break free reflects in the depths of my memory.</i>

00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:24.850
<i>Now and here, my sadness will be my strength.</i>

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:27.520
<i>And I will march toward the future.</i>

00:02:02.530 --> 00:02:04.180
It's such nice weather!

00:02:04.510 --> 00:02:05.550
Yes, it is!

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:09.260
With such a clear sky, we might run into something good!

00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:10.470
Stop it.

00:02:10.700 --> 00:02:13.170
What are you doing?  Let go of me!

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:15.780
OUCH!  Stop it.

00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:20.610
Hold it right there!  You brute, who mistreats the weak, I'm going to punish you!

00:02:20.990 --> 00:02:23.390
Brute, you say, I am just trying to...

00:02:24.330 --> 00:02:27.110
No arguing about it!  Be prepared!

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:35.490
Eh?!  A swindler?

00:02:35.770 --> 00:02:41.990
Yeah, that little girl tried to run out on her bill. That's why...

00:02:42.690 --> 00:02:46.720
I am so sorry.  I didn't know and I took it completely the wrong way.

00:02:47.380 --> 00:02:49.640
Pay.  For the one who swindled me.

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:53.430
Ah, I see.  Why am I paying?!

00:02:53.920 --> 00:02:59.030
That little girl got away, thanks to you. So now, you have to pay for her.

00:03:04.380 --> 00:03:07.170
Uh man, what a complete disaster!

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:09.640
Please cheer up.

00:03:09.740 --> 00:03:10.890
Yes.

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:12.870
Hey, wait.

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:18.810
You're the girl who ran out on her bill.

00:03:19.370 --> 00:03:22.780
Where have you been hiding all this time?  Thanks to you, I...

00:03:23.130 --> 00:03:28.270
You guys seem pretty promising, I like you.  I will allow you to be Shao's servants.

00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:30.290
Huh?

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:34.180
Umm, Shao, I have no idea what you are talking about.

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:38.630
Hey, we just met.  Don't call me by my first name.

00:03:38.770 --> 00:03:39.820
Ah, I am sorry.

00:03:40.340 --> 00:03:42.420
Well, you said your name is Shao.

00:03:42.460 --> 00:03:44.680
Shut up, over there, Kiddie number 2!

00:03:44.960 --> 00:03:47.190
Ha, ha, she called Koumei a kiddie.

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:52.750
Umm, if I am Kiddie number 2, then you are probably Kiddie number 1.

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:54.560
Who's a kiddie?!

00:03:54.590 --> 00:03:56.400
I didn't call you that!

00:03:56.650 --> 00:03:58.590
Anyway!

00:03:59.360 --> 00:04:06.380
You guys will serve me, Son Shoukou, the youngest daughter of the Son family, the ruler of Koutou.

00:04:07.010 --> 00:04:07.840
Got it?

00:04:09.340 --> 00:04:14.340
<b>Kan'u Interrupts Kouchuu's Plot</b>

00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:20.920
Now, where should we eat dinner?

00:04:26.130 --> 00:04:28.560
This is a nice place.  Let's eat here.

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:30.790
We'll eat after we find an inn.

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:37.470
Eh?  Why does that matter?  I'm hungry.  I want food.

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:40.630
Do you even have money for food?

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:44.730
What are you talking about?  Naturally, as servants, you are paying for it.

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:45.810
Hey!

00:04:45.920 --> 00:04:50.300
Look, if I had money, I wouldn't have skipped on my bill at the tea house now, would I?

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:51.510
I see.

00:04:51.620 --> 00:04:54.260
I don't think you should fall for that explanation.

00:04:54.780 --> 00:05:02.220
If that's the case, how did you survive this far?  Don't tell me you've been traveling without any money.

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:07.230
I had enough money until I reached the previous city.

00:05:07.960 --> 00:05:09.210
There, I bought this.

00:05:09.730 --> 00:05:12.690
Eh, you used all of your traveling money to buy that?

00:05:13.180 --> 00:05:15.120
Yes, because I wanted it.

00:05:15.470 --> 00:05:20.100
Here, look at this.  It's all glittery, isn't it beautiful?

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:24.270
When I saw it in the store, it was love at first sight.

00:05:24.410 --> 00:05:28.510
Looking at it makes me feel entranced.

00:05:39.460 --> 00:05:40.330
What are you doing?

00:05:41.510 --> 00:05:42.560
You thief!

00:05:44.370 --> 00:05:45.550
Stop!

00:05:48.090 --> 00:05:50.660
Give it back!

00:05:58.030 --> 00:05:59.280
Wait, what are you going to do?

00:06:12.180 --> 00:06:13.780
<i>Did she miss?</i>

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:22.340
What an amazing shot!

00:06:26.020 --> 00:06:28.000
I am so glad it's not damaged.

00:06:29.670 --> 00:06:31.510
O-O-Ouch!

00:06:33.640 --> 00:06:35.970
Geez, what are you doing, you idiot?

00:06:36.380 --> 00:06:38.360
What just happened?

00:06:38.610 --> 00:06:45.490
Most likely, the arrow caused a strong shock wave that stunned the bird.

00:06:45.600 --> 00:06:48.200
Is that even possible?

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:51.820
Possible or no, it just happened right in front of our eyes.

00:06:52.270 --> 00:06:57.520
Could it have been an accident?  Maybe her aim was a little off, and it accidentally happened that way?

00:06:58.080 --> 00:07:03.750
It could be.  But if she did it on purpose, let's just say it's not humanly possible!

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:10.940
<i>What a terrifying skill.</i>

00:07:18.800 --> 00:07:20.230
That was delicious.

00:07:20.260 --> 00:07:25.170
See?  When I saw this place, I knew right away it was going to be good.

00:07:25.440 --> 00:07:27.980
In other words, I am always right.

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:34.940
Huh, the way I'm built everything becomes delicious when I'm hungry.

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:37.960
Rin Rin, you shouldn't be exactly proud of that.

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:39.940
By the way, Shoukou...

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:44.920
Are you really the youngest daughter of the Son Family?

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:46.580
Of course.

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:50.900
Not that I doubt you, but do you have any proof?

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:55.760
The proof is sitting in front of you, which should be enough.

00:07:55.900 --> 00:07:58.090
That's what she says.  What do you guys think?

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:03.240
No matter how you cut it, it's weird for a princess to wander around alone and show her bellybutton.

00:08:03.310 --> 00:08:06.720
Lately the weather's been nice, so maybe she...

00:08:07.240 --> 00:08:09.570
Hey, stop whispering, I can hear you!

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:14.330
If that's the case how come you're not traveling with an entourage?

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:18.570
Eh?  Because... I have my reasons.

00:08:18.850 --> 00:08:26.050
Just to let you know I didn't run away because I got fed up with ceremonial life in the castle.

00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:29.420
What's with that look?

00:08:29.590 --> 00:08:31.030
Oh dear.

00:08:31.510 --> 00:08:35.990
You ate every single bite.  How about another cup of tea?

00:08:36.170 --> 00:08:37.980
Ah, thank you very much.

00:08:38.640 --> 00:08:43.440
You girls seem to be on a journey.  Are you here to see the parade tomorrow?

00:08:44.060 --> 00:08:45.660
Huh, a parade?

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:48.760
Oh, you are not.  I was sure.

00:08:48.930 --> 00:08:51.950
Ma'am, what parade are you talking about?

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:55.290
The third elder son of our neighboring city's feudal lord...

00:08:55.470 --> 00:09:00.190
He's going marry the daughter of the local lord.

00:09:00.510 --> 00:09:05.270
Tomorrow afternoon, his procession will pass through the street in front of here.

00:09:05.410 --> 00:09:06.660
Oh.

00:09:08.470 --> 00:09:12.890
Rumor has it that it will be quite dazzling.

00:09:13.030 --> 00:09:17.930
And also, the third eldest son is exceptionally handsome.

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:22.590
All the interested villagers have gathered here.

00:09:23.110 --> 00:09:27.520
I see.  At any rate, marriage is a happy occasion.

00:09:27.980 --> 00:09:31.490
However, a strange rumor has also been circulating lately.

00:09:31.660 --> 00:09:32.570
And what's that?

00:09:34.790 --> 00:09:42.650
This conversation stays between us.  Some of the local lord's relatives and aides seem to be against this nuptial.

00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:49.150
And the same group is said to be plotting the assassination of the groom.

00:09:49.600 --> 00:09:51.310
How disturbing.

00:09:51.340 --> 00:09:55.170
Specially, if it happened on the long-awaited ceremonial day, it would be truly horrible.

00:09:55.760 --> 00:09:58.470
Now it all makes sense.

00:09:58.570 --> 00:09:59.410
What?

00:09:59.650 --> 00:10:04.870
Remember, when we entered the city, we were closely inspected.

00:10:05.560 --> 00:10:09.940
That's one way to stop suspicious people from entering the city.

00:10:10.050 --> 00:10:14.600
The feudal lord must have arranged plenty of guards for tomorrow's ceremony.

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:15.400
Yes.

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:21.000
A plot that leaks beforehand rarely succeeds.

00:10:21.210 --> 00:10:22.880
It would be nice if that was the case.

00:10:23.510 --> 00:10:30.390
Anyways, I am fed up with all these killings.
I wonder if this world will ever become peaceful again.

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:36.790
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:10:37.660 --> 00:10:40.850
Specially-made ramen with extra menma, and no garlic or roast pork.

00:10:54.940 --> 00:10:59.770
Geez, why did all four of us have to squeeze in a twin room?

00:10:59.810 --> 00:11:02.550
Thanks to that, I didn't sleep well.

00:11:02.830 --> 00:11:06.070
How dare you complain, after snoring all night and exposing your bellybutton?

00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:11.450
Hey, don't just make up stuff!  There's no way I, Shao, would snore.

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:13.850
Well, you definitely did.

00:11:15.310 --> 00:11:16.910
Stop your bickering.

00:11:17.190 --> 00:11:20.880
Hey, quit lolling around and hurry up.

00:11:28.980 --> 00:11:29.540
That's...

00:11:34.510 --> 00:11:39.650
<i>Tomorrow afternoon, his procession will pass through the street in front of here.</i>

00:11:40.310 --> 00:11:43.570
<i>But if she did it on purpose, let's just say it's not humanly possible!</i>

00:11:43.860 --> 00:11:45.940
<i>What a terrifying skill.</i>

00:11:48.890 --> 00:11:51.780
Hey, where are you going?

00:12:02.530 --> 00:12:03.610
A guest, to see me?

00:12:04.100 --> 00:12:07.540
Yes.  She said she would like to express her gratitude for yesterday.

00:12:10.980 --> 00:12:12.610
Gratitude for yesterday?

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:16.970
I see. You are the one from yesterday.

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:22.310
My name is Kan'u.  Thank you for helping my companion yesterday.

00:12:22.470 --> 00:12:29.320
Nah, it was not a big deal.  I am a bit nosy so I couldn't resist getting involved.

00:12:30.530 --> 00:12:35.310
Ah, I forgot to introduce myself.  My name is Kouchuu Kanshou.

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:37.800
How rude of me, I will bring us some tea.

00:12:38.220 --> 00:12:39.570
Please don't trouble yourself.

00:12:42.020 --> 00:12:43.690
What nice weather we are having.

00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:48.770
You can see the main street clearly from here.

00:12:51.190 --> 00:12:56.790
The heads of the passing people look so small from here.

00:12:56.920 --> 00:13:01.610
In addition an amateur archer can hardly hit a moving target.

00:13:01.900 --> 00:13:07.210
You can't blame the guards for not considering that threat.

00:13:07.670 --> 00:13:11.170
Kan'u, what are you implying?

00:13:11.860 --> 00:13:16.970
I was just thinking if there was an archer whose skills equal the god of archery...

00:13:17.360 --> 00:13:20.180
All sorts of impossible scenarios can happen.

00:13:26.690 --> 00:13:27.510
Don't move.

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:33.510
It seems your skills with a bow and arrow does not extend to long weapons.

00:13:34.680 --> 00:13:36.980
Rin Rin, you can come in now.

00:13:45.590 --> 00:13:50.210
After my husband passed away a few years ago...

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:55.610
My little girl Riri and I lived quietly in a village not too far from here.

00:13:56.720 --> 00:14:00.290
One day, returning from an errand in the neighboring city...

00:14:00.460 --> 00:14:04.520
My daughter was gone.  Instead, I found this letter.

00:14:04.850 --> 00:14:09.300
<i>We have your daughter.  If you follow our instruction, she will be returned unharmed.</i>

00:14:09.460 --> 00:14:12.510
<i>If not, I can't guarantee her life.</i>

00:14:13.030 --> 00:14:14.130
Cowards!

00:14:14.150 --> 00:14:15.040
Unforgivable!

00:14:16.240 --> 00:14:18.540
At the rendezvous place...

00:14:22.010 --> 00:14:24.960
<i>Where is my daughter?  She is safe, right?</i>

00:14:25.480 --> 00:14:28.000
<i>It all depends on you.</i>

00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:31.730
<i>What is it you want from me?</i>

00:14:34.130 --> 00:14:37.960
I see. You agreed to the assassination unwillingly.

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:45.060
Yes.  It's unforgivable to take a life no matter the reason.

00:14:45.980 --> 00:14:50.700
But... But my daughter, Riri is everything to me.

00:14:50.860 --> 00:14:54.400
This is the only way I can save her.

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:00.720
Hey, what are these?

00:15:01.730 --> 00:15:05.500
She drew these pictures while being confined.

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:09.950
Yesterday, one of the kidnappers brought it to me as a proof of life.

00:15:11.460 --> 00:15:12.170
That drawing is...

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:14.610
This one?

00:15:15.360 --> 00:15:17.780
Why did she draw this picture?

00:15:17.880 --> 00:15:18.960
I wonder.

00:15:19.290 --> 00:15:21.350
Koumei, what about this drawing?

00:15:22.010 --> 00:15:24.760
Doesn't that remind you of someone?

00:15:25.180 --> 00:15:26.750
Ah, the old man with the beard at the tea house!

00:15:27.770 --> 00:15:29.800
Does that mean the tea house owner is involved?

00:15:29.960 --> 00:15:31.800
Nah, I don't think so.

00:15:32.520 --> 00:15:40.310
If this was the picture of one of the criminals, they wouldn't make the mistake of giving it to Kouchuu.

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:47.320
I think she probably drew what she could see from her prison.

00:15:48.170 --> 00:15:50.920
"What she could see from her prison", huh.

00:15:52.270 --> 00:15:54.990
Could it be the abandoned house across from the tea house?

00:15:55.570 --> 00:15:58.420
Do you have an idea where my daughter is?

00:15:58.920 --> 00:16:00.360
Eh?  Well, maybe...

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:03.240
Please tell me where!  I'll go right away!

00:16:03.860 --> 00:16:09.030
Please wait.  We will tell you, but I don't think it's a good idea for you to go.

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:10.020
Why?!

00:16:10.640 --> 00:16:17.970
If you go there, they will recognize you, which might put your daughter's life in danger.

00:16:18.390 --> 00:16:24.410
If you truly value your daughter's life, stay here and act as if nothing has changed.

00:16:24.490 --> 00:16:25.210
But...

00:16:25.280 --> 00:16:26.230
Kouchuu...

00:16:26.820 --> 00:16:30.750
I am sure it is painful; but it would be in your best interest to do as Koumei says.

00:16:33.600 --> 00:16:34.910
Kouchuu.

00:16:35.500 --> 00:16:39.030
It won't take too long to go back to the tea house, let's hurry.

00:16:39.260 --> 00:16:40.050
That means...

00:16:43.230 --> 00:16:49.060
Kouchuu, I promise to save your daughter's life, even if it would cost mine.

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:52.260
Kan'u.

00:16:56.590 --> 00:16:57.830
I'm coming in.

00:16:58.420 --> 00:16:59.240
What do you want?

00:16:59.400 --> 00:17:01.760
Don't give me the cold shoulder.

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:05.500
My boss wants me to keep an eye on you.

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:07.490
I see.  Knock yourself out.

00:17:08.410 --> 00:17:12.960
<i>That was close...  If I would have left...</i>

00:17:17.580 --> 00:17:18.760
What?

00:17:19.120 --> 00:17:20.890
Nothing. I guess it was just my imagination.

00:17:31.300 --> 00:17:34.380
What?  There is a kidnapped child in the rundown-house across the street.

00:17:34.510 --> 00:17:38.310
In order to save her, we need your help.

00:17:38.870 --> 00:17:40.280
Eh, my help?

00:17:46.730 --> 00:17:48.330
Hey, anything out of the ordinary?

00:17:48.460 --> 00:17:52.330
Not at all, matter of fact it's too damn normal and I'm bored.

00:17:52.330 --> 00:17:55.310
Stop talking nonsense.

00:17:56.130 --> 00:17:59.570
There is no way, I, Shao, will steal from your shop.

00:17:59.660 --> 00:18:03.970
What are you talking about?  You ran out on your bill just the other day.  It has to be you this time as well.

00:18:04.380 --> 00:18:10.540
Fine, if you don't believe me, I will strip down and you can search me.

00:18:10.640 --> 00:18:11.490
What?!

00:18:16.960 --> 00:18:18.300
Happy  now?

00:18:18.630 --> 00:18:20.270
Oh my god...

00:18:22.230 --> 00:18:25.080
No.  You might have stuff under your skirt.

00:18:25.270 --> 00:18:26.680
Fine.

00:18:27.170 --> 00:18:30.120
Hey, take a look, something interesting is going on.

00:18:30.480 --> 00:18:31.560
What is it?

00:18:32.220 --> 00:18:35.690
Well then, you're satisfied now?

00:18:38.860 --> 00:18:42.170
<i>Geez, they'd better hurry up.  I can't strip any more than this.</i>

00:18:54.460 --> 00:18:56.310
<i>They have successfully distracted the bandits.</i>

00:18:57.530 --> 00:18:58.000
One.

00:18:58.560 --> 00:18:58.980
Two.

00:18:59.570 --> 00:18:59.930
Three.

00:19:00.650 --> 00:19:01.170
Go now!

00:19:07.420 --> 00:19:08.440
Who are you?

00:19:09.720 --> 00:19:15.870
I usually introduce myself, but a despicable bunch like you, don't deserve an introduction!

00:19:16.330 --> 00:19:17.120
What did you say?

00:19:17.150 --> 00:19:18.000
Stop messing with us.

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:18.650
Let's finish her.

00:19:24.520 --> 00:19:25.270
Damn you.

00:19:31.660 --> 00:19:35.590
Aisha, I took care of all the goons downstairs.

00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:36.410
Good!

00:19:38.140 --> 00:19:39.460
You are Riri, right?

00:19:39.620 --> 00:19:40.500
Yeah.

00:19:41.550 --> 00:19:45.350
Come with me, your mom is waiting for you.

00:19:47.070 --> 00:19:48.360
My mommy?

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:51.730
Kan'u!

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:54.320
Here.

00:19:54.650 --> 00:19:57.270
As expected, you've planned everything.

00:19:57.850 --> 00:20:01.050
Not really, after you charged in...

00:20:01.150 --> 00:20:05.920
A person wearing a weird mask told me to use the horse if we were in a hurry.

00:20:06.110 --> 00:20:07.420
Eh?  A masked person?

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:12.690
Let's leave the questions till later.  We are running out of time.  Please hurry.

00:20:12.730 --> 00:20:13.910
You're right, let's go.

00:20:16.260 --> 00:20:17.800
Riri, we're leaving.

00:20:17.870 --> 00:20:19.150
Hold on tight!

00:20:19.380 --> 00:20:19.900
Okay!

00:20:22.260 --> 00:20:25.530
<i>Please make it in time.</i>

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:32.180
Hey, it's time, you're ready?

00:20:33.360 --> 00:20:34.470
I understand.

00:20:48.650 --> 00:20:49.770
Kan'u.

00:21:04.210 --> 00:21:04.960
You can't come through.

00:21:05.060 --> 00:21:05.650
Dismount the horse!

00:21:20.490 --> 00:21:23.010
<i>With this crowd, I can't make it to the inn fast enough.</i>

00:21:24.610 --> 00:21:27.500
I don't have any other choice.  I have to take a chance.

00:21:30.870 --> 00:21:32.380
He's here.  It's all up to you now.

00:21:32.680 --> 00:21:33.790
Okay.

00:21:40.200 --> 00:21:41.680
Hey, what are you waiting for?

00:21:42.860 --> 00:21:45.210
<i>I can't stall anymore...</i>

00:22:00.510 --> 00:22:04.730
Mo...th...er...

00:22:09.510 --> 00:22:11.970
Hey, what do you think you're doing?

00:22:28.970 --> 00:22:31.720
It's a shame, but we have to part here.

00:22:32.140 --> 00:22:36.370
Kan'u, words can't express my gratitude for what you have done.

00:22:36.570 --> 00:22:38.240
Thank you, big sister.

00:22:38.660 --> 00:22:43.900
Please, there is no need; you've already thanked me enough.

00:22:44.030 --> 00:22:49.760
Kan'u, as two friends raising small children, let's vow to do our best from here on.

00:22:49.930 --> 00:22:51.200
What?  A child?

00:22:51.340 --> 00:22:55.860
Oh dear, I'm sorry.  I was sure Rin Rin was...

00:22:56.350 --> 00:23:00.210
What are you talking about?  Rin Rin is not my daughter.

00:23:00.280 --> 00:23:04.630
Aisha and I sealed our relationship in bed.

00:23:04.760 --> 00:23:06.470
Oh, that means...

00:23:06.530 --> 00:23:10.530
No, it's nothing like that! She means we made a vow of sisterhood.  That's all!

00:23:10.560 --> 00:23:11.410
Is that so?

00:23:12.590 --> 00:23:16.760
Seriously, stop saying things that can be misconstrued!

00:23:29.490 --> 00:23:34.630
<i>I am the heroine of this world, no matter what.</i>

00:23:34.700 --> 00:23:39.180
<i>Such a splendid world,
no questions asked, because I said so.</i>

00:23:40.920 --> 00:23:45.440
<i>Anywhere I am, it always turns into paradise.</i>

00:23:46.160 --> 00:23:49.960
<i>Every season, mellow and carefree.
Today and tomorrow, always an adventure.</i>

00:23:50.060 --> 00:23:55.130
<i>I run away when times are tough.
But get involved when easy and fun.</i>

00:23:55.170 --> 00:24:00.310
<i>If I stress, I just stop and smell the roses.  If there's a great opportunity, I go for it!</i>

00:24:00.310 --> 00:24:05.290
<i>There are so many things that I want.</i>

00:24:05.420 --> 00:24:12.980
<i>I am so brave, that I can take on the invincible.</i>

00:24:13.110 --> 00:24:18.160
<i>After all said and done, I am the heroine of this world.</i>

00:24:18.320 --> 00:24:23.430
<i>The world revolves around me.  I am the center of the world!</i>

00:24:23.460 --> 00:24:28.470
<i>I am the heroine of this world, no matter what.</i>

00:24:28.570 --> 00:24:33.680
<i>Such a splendid world,
no questions asked, because I said so.</i>

00:24:44.010 --> 00:24:51.000
<b>Cutie-cute</b>
